  QuizQuestion(topic: "estequiometria", question: "¿Cuántos moles hay en 36 g de agua? (M = 18.02 g/mol)", options: ["0.50 mol", "1.00 mol", "2.00 mol", "3.60 mol"], answer: 2, explanation: "n = m/M = 36 g ÷ 18.02 g/mol ≈ 2.00 mol."),
