  QuizQuestion(topic: "estequiometria", question: "¿Cuántas moléculas hay en 0.25 mol de CO₂?", options: ["1.51×10²³", "3.01×10²³", "6.02×10²³", "1.20×10²⁴"], answer: 0, explanation: "N = 0.25 × 6.022×10²³ = 1.51×10²³ moléculas."),
